<article class="env-lemma" id="01UW">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01UW">Lemma <span data-tag="01UW">17.28.13</span>.</a> Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X'' \ar[d] \ar[r]_ g &  X' \ar[d] \ar[r]_ f &  X \ar[d] \\  S'' \ar[r] &  S' \ar[r] &  S }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a commutative diagram of ringed spaces. With notation as in Lemma <a href="/tag/08RU" data-tag="08RU">17.28.12</a> we have </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  c_{f \circ g} = c_ g \circ g^* c_ f  \]
</div>
  <p> as maps $(f \circ g)^*\Omega _{X/S} \to \Omega _{X''/S''}$. </p>
